@startuml
[*] as Initial State
Idle as Idle
Processing Request as ProcessingRequest
Gathering Videos as GatheringVideos
Adding Details as AddingDetails
Sending Suggestions as SendingSuggestions
Final State as FinalState

Initial State ->> Idle :
Idle ->> ProcessingRequest : Video suggestion request from a user
ProcessingRequest ->> ProcessingRequest : User identification (e.g., login credentials)
ProcessingRequest ->> GatheringVideos : Change in user profile or preferences
GatheringVideos ->> GatheringVideos : Trending videos from the user's area
GatheringVideos ->> GatheringVideos : Videos with similar tags
GatheringVideos ->> GatheringVideos : Videos from similar genres
GatheringVideos ->> GatheringVideos : Promoted videos
GatheringVideos ->> AddingDetails : Different types of videos have been gathered

AddingDetails ->> SendingSuggestions : Additional details such as thumbnails and view counts added to suggested videos
SendingSuggestions ->> FinalState : Suggested videos sent to user

FinalState ->> [*] : System reaches final state after sending suggested videos
@enduml
